al \\u0026 exhaust.\\n   - **Fix**: give `GEO_F1_FIA_RainLight` its own single-user FIA red material (`Mat_FIA_RainLight`, color `(1.0, 0.02, 0.01)`).\\n5. **`@anim` Camera-to-Car Raycast Occlusions (26 shots, `f=1..2161` step 2)**:\\n   - Zero ground penetrations (`min_cam_z = 0.45m`), zero frustum escapes.\\n   - **`Cam_S20_StoweTele` (`f=1682..1788`) — SEVERE (24/54 sampled frames blocked)**: `cam=[91.21, 959.03, 2.8]` (`lead=-130, side=-13` from Stowe) looks back across curved barrier/billboards, blocked by `V5_FencePosts` (`f=1712, 1748`), `V5_Ad_70` (`f=1714..1716`), `V5_Ad_72` (`f=1722..1732`, causing bright center glare `CenterL=160.8`), and `V5_Ad_73` (`f=1762..1788`). Reposition inside the barrier corridor with clear sightline down Hangar Straight / Stowe entry.\\n   - **`Cam_S04_Hairpin` (`f=295..401`)**: `f=375` blocked by `V5_Brake_1_150` (`15.1m` vs car `22.1m`; `side=-8.6` sits behind `9.4m` brake-board line — move `side` inside `-7.8m` or adjust `h`/`lead`).\\n   - **`Cam_S17_Maggotts` (`f=1415..1508`)**: `f=1415..1417` blocked by `V5_Barrier` (`34–37m` vs car `94–97m` at `h=1.35m` — raise `h` to `~2.1m` or pull `side` inward).\\n   - **`Cam_S13_WoodcoteTele` (`f=1082..1161`)**: `f=1160..1161` blocked by `V5_Bridge_B_Piers` (`side=12.0` aligns with `14.0m` pier — shift `side` to `~9.0m`).\\n   - **`Cam_S14_HeliDrop` (`f=1162..1241`)**: `f=1170` crosses `V5_Bridge_B_Deck` (`30.5m` vs car `37.6m`).\\n\\n### P1 — Visual, Rig/Shader \\u0026 Pipeline Findings\\n6. **Sky Banding \\u0026 Aerial Exposure (`@env-2`)**:\\n   - PIL row-derivative confirms horizon banding on low-angle shots (`SkyStepMax`: `S18=14.14`, `S13=12.50`, `S03=9.67`, `S11=4.71`) from 32-ring / 7-stop vertex `V5_SkyDome`. High-altitude shots (`S14` MeanL=36.9, `S23` MeanL=41.3) read dark vs track shots (MeanL=75–100). Keep road/line/kerb `Specular IOR Level \\u003c= 0.03` (currently compliant: 0 violations).\\n7. **Outliner Hygiene (`@env-2` \\u0026 `@anim`)**:\\n   - `v5_stage_env.blend` (616 objs, 0 orphans): 21 `V5_*` Empties are in `V5_04_Stands` / `V5_06_Props`; only `RIG_F1_Race` sits in root `Scene Collection` (move to `SCIFI_F1_2035`). `@env-2`: ensure any new `EM_*`, `V5_DRS*`, `V5_Bollard*`, `V5_Sausage*`, or pit timing objects match `_GROUPS` so 0 objects land in root.\\n   - `v5_stage_anim.blend`: `LGT_V5Car_0..2` and all 26 `Cam_S*` are currently dumped in root `Scene Collection` — `@anim` put `LGT_V5Car_*` in `V5_07_Lighting` and cameras + `V5_CamFocus` in `V5_08_Cameras`.\\n8. **Exact Car Rig / Mesh / Material Map (for `@env-2` \\u0026 `@anim`)**:\\n   - **Brake Glow**: `GEO_F1_BrakeGlow_FL/FR/RL/RR` (`Bone_Wheel_FL..RR`) ALREADY have `Mat_Brake_HeatGlow` (`Emission` strength driven by valid driver `heat*9.0` -\\u003e `RIG_F1_Race[\\\"brake_heat\\\"]`), sitting 1mm outboard of `GEO_F1_BrakeDisc_FL..RR` (`Mat_BrakeDisc_CarbonCeramic`) + `GEO_F1_BrakeCaliper_FL..RR` (`Mat_Caliper_Anodized`). Why barely visible: `brake_heat` has zero thermal inertia (snaps to 0 as soon as `acc\\u003e=0` before corner apex) and `Mat_BrakeDisc_CarbonCeramic`/`Mat_Caliper_Anodized` stay dark. `@env-2`: enrich `Mat_BrakeDisc_CarbonCeramic`, `Mat_Caliper_Anodized` \\u0026 `Mat_Brake_HeatGlow`; `@anim`: add thermal decay to `rig[\\\"brake_heat\\\"]` so rotors glow into apexes (`S04`, `S09`, `S11`, `S21`, `S24`).\\n   - **Steering Wheel \\u0026 Onboard**: `Bone_Steering_Wheel` (`GEO_F1_Cockpit_SteeringWheel`, `GEO_F1_Steering_LCDScreen`, `GEO_F1_ShiftLED_00..14`) ALREADY has active driver `rotation_euler[1] = steer * steer_ratio * pi/180` (`steer_ratio=5.0`). In car-local (`Bone_Heading`) space, steering wheel is at `y=[0.12..0.19], z=[0.56..0.73]` and Halo pylon at `y=[0.40..0.58], z=[0.64..0.89]`, whereas BOTH `Cam_S02_Onboard` (`fwd=2.55`) \\u0026 `Cam_S19_Onboard3` (`fwd=2.48`) are on the nosecone tip! Placing one onboard at over-shoulder/T-cam (`fwd=-0.46, side=0.0..0.12, h=0.88`, `0.64m \\u003e clip_start=0.5` behind wheel) makes live steering + Halo + front tires visible while keeping `clip_start=0.5`.\\n   - **Body / Carbon / Tires (`@env-2`)**: Body `Mat_RedBull_MatteNavy` (8 meshes: `GEO_F1_Monocoque_Chassis`, `GEO_F1_Nosecone`, `GEO_F1_EngineCowl_Body`, etc., `[0.011,0.012,0.014]`, rough `0.36`, coat `0.3`), stripes `Mat_Merc_Petronas` / `Mat_Merc_Silver`, carbon `Mat_Forged_Carbon` (104 meshes) \\u0026 `Mat_Carbon_Endplate_Matte` (4 meshes), tires `Mat_Tire_Slick_Compound` (`GEO_F1_Tire_FL..RR`) + `Mat_PZero_Pirelli_Sidewall` (`DEC_Tire_Sidewall_FL..RR`).\\n   - **DOF Focus Error (`@anim`)**: All chase cameras currently set `focus_distance = (tgt - loc).length` where `tgt` is `3.0–4.6m` ahead of the car (`maxFocusErr = 3.58–4.58m`). Using `focus_object = V5_CamFocus` (`Bone_Root + 0.45m Z`) fixes focus error to `0.00m`.\\n9. **`v5_clay.py` \\u0026 `v5_viewport_fast.py` Bugs (`@anim`)**:\\n   - `v5_clay.py`: sets `exposure = 0.20` on `Standard` view transform, **but `scene.animation_data` exposure fcurve (`0.50` at `f=2145` -\\u003e `-3.6` at `f=2161`) overrides it back to `0.50`**, causing up to **25.1% highlight clipping** on `Standard` (`S20=25.1%`, `S21=6.5%`, `S10=6.0%`) and non-black `f=2161` (`MeanL=41.7`). Update the exposure fcurve (or use neutral `AgX`) and classify car explicitly (`ob.parent == rig` or `GEO_F1_`/`GEO_MERC_`/`DEC_`) so any `EM_*` env meshes never get `CLAY_Car`.\\n   - `v5_viewport_fast.py`: never calls `bpy.ops.wm.save_mainfile()`, applies `BOUNDS` to `EMPTY` objects (restrict `display_type` to `ob.type == 'MESH'`), and should include `\\\"EM_\\\"`, `\\\"V5_Pit\\\"`, `\\\"V5_Barrier\\\"`, `\\\"V5_FencePosts\\\"`.\",\"time\":\"2026-11-18 13:34:50\",\"request_id\":\"dfe53c99-2946-46df-85e3-1e35263c26a1\"}],\"head\":9}"}
